thematical reasoning) or exceptionally rich world knowledge."]})})]}),c.jsxs("div",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:360:11",className:"rounded-2xl border border-baidu-blue/15 bg-baidu-blue/5 p-5 shadow-sm",children:[c.jsx("div",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:361:13",className:"mb-3 inline-flex rounded-full bg-baidu-blue px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white",children:"w/ pe (LLMs)"}),c.jsx("h4",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:364:13",className:"mb-2 text-base font-bold text-baidu-dark",children:L?"使用大语言模型增强":"With Large LLM Enhancement"}),c.jsx("p",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:365:13",className:"text-sm leading-relaxed text-baidu-gray",children:L?c.jsxs(c.Fragment,{children:["我们发现，用大语言模型（如 ",c.jsx("strong",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:367:35",className:"text-baidu-dark",children:"gemini-3.1-pro-preview"}),"）做零样本提示词增强，在所有场景中都能带来明显更好的效果。大语言模型凭借丰富的世界知识和推理能力，能生成信息密度极高、结构精确的提示词，将 ERNIE-Image 的生成潜力充分释放出来。"]}):c.jsxs(c.Fragment,{children:["We find that using an LLM such as ",c.jsx("strong",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:368:55",className:"text-baidu-dark",children:"gemini-3.1-pro-preview"})," for zero-shot prompt enhancement yields markedly better results across the board. With deeper world knowledge and stronger reasoning, the LLM produces information-dense, structurally precise prompts that bring out ERNIE-Image's full generation potential."]})})]})]})]}),g&&c.jsxs("div",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:376:9",className:"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/95 p-4",onClick:()=>M(null),children:[c.jsx("button",{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:380:11",type:"button",className:"absolute right-4 top-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 transition-colors hover:bg-white/20",onClick:()=>M(null),children:c.jsx(ss,{"code-path":"src/sections/PEModel.tsx:385:13",className:"h-5 w-5 text-white"})}),c.jsxs("div",{"code-path":"src/section